// Rows 3i/3j (BT-4431): a compiled class method shadowed by a class-side
// extension (ADR 0066) in vb_shadowed_math_ext.bt. A literal send to
// `double:` is a guarded static call whose key is never installed
// (`direct_call_ok/2` is false while the extension exists), so every send
// declines to `class_send`, which runs the extension in the class process.
Object subclass: VbShadowedMath

  class double: x :: Integer -> Integer => x * 2
